WEBVTT

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.580
I'm gonna be late for school.

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.970
Bye!

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:11.400
Mum!

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:14.220
Don't forget to record that show!

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.620
What show?

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:18.580
I told you, the one that's on at 5:00.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.900
Bye, Dad, I'm on my way.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:38.100
Mum, I made breakfast, so all you have to do is reheat it.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.970
Yeah. Thanks.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.410
The End of the Beginning

00:00:56.660 --> 00:00:58.280
7 Days Earlier

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.110
Her parents have contacted us too.

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:07.250
They haven't seen her since last night.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:12.810
It had to go after an alien fighter, of all people.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:15.170
You shouldn't be so careless, Megumi.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:18.160
I'm sorry.

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:23.900
Anyway, we still have time to make it.

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:26.180
Get things running again.

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:32.320
Once Yellow Knife breaks into her, it'll be too late.

00:01:36.910 --> 00:01:39.480
You seem to be the strongest.

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:44.910
You seem best able to understand me.

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:50.720
So, please... please...

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:53.980
Protect me.

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:57.470
Yes, brother.

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:12.360
Something's growing out of it.

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:17.910
Ow!

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:19.820
Miyu!

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:25.400
This is terrible.

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:30.170
90% of students and half the teachers are complaining of nausea and headaches.

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:33.670
But this wasn't part of the plan.

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.310
I know.

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:38.760
But do something about it, Miss Hisakawa.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:41.010
After all, it is your job.

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:45.180
It hurts, it hurts, it hurts!

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:49.600
It doesn't hurt any more.

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:53.550
If you take off the Borg, your head will hurt.

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:56.550
I can't get changed...

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.010
Ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:03.210
Stop squirming!

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:04.700
— It hurts!
— Stay Still!

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.720
What's the matter, Miss Ootani?

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:12.630
Nothing, she's fine.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:17.100
Okay, then, let's start our plan.

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:19.010
— Okay.
— 'Kay...

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:21.630
Miss Toomine is inside that alien.

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:24.080
What?!

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:27.210
Teacher. Kasumi...?

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:30.850
Miss Toomine was caught by this alien.

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:37.290
So, you two are going to help rescue her.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:38.370
Got it?

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:39.820
Yes!

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:45.030
I finally figured you out.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.740
You were all alone.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:53.040
Since I went away, you've been all alone.

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:56.680
You don't like to be alone.

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:59.000
It's scary to be alone.

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:01.720
Isn't that right, Kasumi?

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:04.680
Yes, brother.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:08.600
Teacher!

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:11.860
We found Kasumi.

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:14.600
Miss Kawamura, mark the area.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.530
Don't do it.

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:32.690
Kumi!

00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:33.830
Good luck!

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:36.710
I'm okay.

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:51.270
Why, Kumi?

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:05.430
She messed up.

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.380
Ouch.

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:18.100
Oh, we've really done it now.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:21.550
Miss Toomine?!

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:30.850
Teacher?

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:32.810
Kumi?

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:34.850
Anybody?

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:38.310
Where has everybody gone?

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:43.770
They disappeared.

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:47.900
Everybody disappeared in an instant.

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:50.260
Yellow Knife.

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:52.900
And Yuri.

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:55.890
And Miss Hisakawa.

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:59.410
Everybody's disappeared.

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:02.620
You're all alone.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:04.210
Huh? What's that?

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:05.800
You're all alone.

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:10.890
What? Who? Why?

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:14.980
You're all alone. All alone.
All alone.

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:25.040
Mummy, Mummy, Mummy!

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:27.500
No! Don't leave me!

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:29.680
Mummy!

00:06:30.430 --> 00:06:33.370
Daddy! Help me, Daddy!

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:35.790
Help me, Daddy! Help!

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:38.870
— No, no!
— Kumi.

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:44.380
Borg.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.120
What's going on?

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:55.720
Kumi.

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:58.500
You're not alone.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:06:59.690
I'm always with you.

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:03.310
We'll always be together.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:05.660
We depend on each other.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:08.490
We'll be together till one of us dies.

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:12.070
I'll always be by your side.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:14.490
I'll be by your side and will protect you.

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.420
Always protect you.

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:17.330
Borg.

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:20.860
So, don't cry, Kumi.

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:23.850
Usually this sort of thing wouldn't make you cry.

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:25.250
Everything's okay.

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:27.480
Think about it.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:30.960
Everybody couldn't have disappeared.

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:34.550
Figure it out.

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:38.470
It's too early to give up.

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:43.020
Keep fighting, Kumi.

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.530
Kumi? Teacher?

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:58.120
Where are you?

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:00.870
Isn't anybody here?

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:04.720
Miyu? Where are you?

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:10.050
You guys!

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:13.370
You're so mean.

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:16.600
Leaving me here all alone.

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.020
I wonder if I can go home.

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:25.980
Yuri?

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:34.210
Wow! I'm flying.

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:35.660
Good girl, Yuri!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.560
You've learned to fly.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:39.370
Really?

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:45.150
Yes, of course. So, now you're okay on your own.

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:46.280
So long.

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:47.420
Bye-bye.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:50.290
You're on your own!

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:53.640
Something's wrong with you, Borg!

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:55.840
Borg!

00:08:57.570 --> 00:09:00.270
Ouch, that hurt.

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:15.460
Borg. Borg?

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:21.790
Borg? Are you gone?

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:27.300
Don't get in my way!

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:28.330
Yuri's mine!

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:36.510
Borg?

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:38.140
Brother.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:41.510
Huh? Kasumi?

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:51.840
Well done, Kasumi!

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:53.670
Top in abacus class!

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:54.690
Smart girl.

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.880
The abacus is fun.

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.160
That's why I like it.

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:00.370
Congratulations, Kasumi!

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.280
You won another competition.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:03.450
What was it this time?

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:05.460
The calligraphy contest.

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:06.910
I love Japanese calligraphy.

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:11.150
I love baseball. I love basketball.

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:14.590
I love volleyball, too. I love lacrosse.

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:18.380
I love playing the piano.
I love drawing, too.

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:22.930
Dad, Mum, brother, I love you.

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:26.800
Grandfather, Grandmother, teacher!
I love you all!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:28.290
Kasumi.

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:29.850
What, brother?

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:32.040
Sorry, Kasumi.

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:34.240
I'm going to study abroad.

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:36.380
Study abroad?

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:38.110
Good-bye, Kasumi.

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:41.070
Brother! Brother!

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:42.780
Bye, Kasumi.

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:46.250
Brother! Brother! Brother!

00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:48.000
— Good-bye.
— Brother!

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:53.500
Next time you'll win the Japanese chess contest!

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:59.210
It's because I love it. Because I love it.

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:02.100
Because I love everything and everyone.

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:05.970
I love everyone, so why...?

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:08.130
Why, why?!

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:20.450
Kasumi?

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.030
What?

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:39.460
You're home, brother.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:45.430
Kasumi, you're wrong — it's an alien.

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:49.000
Welcome home, brother.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.770
That thing's an alien!

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:53.010
Brother.

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:55.230
It's an alien.

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:09.290
Brother!

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:26.550
Kasumi. Yellow Knife.

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:27.470
You're not here, are you?

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:38.270
You are here.

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:39.670
I can't see you.

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:42.130
I can't even smell you.

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:48.540
I can't feel you.

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:49.950
But you are here.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.870
That's correct.

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:54.200
So, now what are you going to do?

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:57.830
First, I have to find Yuri.

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:01.250
We can find her, seeing as she's one of your teammates.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:04.190
Kasumi...

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:07.500
You're wrong, that's an alien.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.180
Get lost, would ya!

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.270
Kasumi!

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:17.970
Go away!

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:19.900
Yuri!

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:23.350
Huh? Borg!

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:26.180
You're such a baby!

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:29.620
Kasumi.

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:37.840
Your assaults won't work on me.

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.710
Because I'm not alone.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:43.950
Why did you come here, Yellow Knife?

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:45.170
Give Miss Toomine back!

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:50.660
I didn't want to come here.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:54.540
I didn't want to come to this scary place.

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:57.010
It's your fault!

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:02.190
You've monopolised everything. That's why this has happened.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:05.360
I didn't want to come here!

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:13.410
You messed up again.

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:17.120
Principal.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:20.750
Honestly, how can you be of help from down there?!

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:23.200
I'm sorry.

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:25.710
— Tell me what's going on.
— Okay.

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:27.720
Loneliness.

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:32.550
Yellow Knife chose to use loneliness as his method of assault.

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:36.830
Kumi, Kumi, Kumi.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.520
I thought you were on the roof.

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:45.480
The alien went into Kasumi's tummy.

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:49.820
We're gonna go and help Kasumi.

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:51.320
You're alone.

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:58.660
Are you okay, Kumi?

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:02.540
Kumi?

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:04.500
I'm okay.

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:08.390
Loneliness.

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:10.890
In order to inspire fear in humans that came near it,

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:16.490
Yellow Knife, which swallowed Miss Toomine, used the feelings she fears.

00:15:16.490 --> 00:15:19.100
He used loneliness as his means of attack.

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:25.800
We probably won't be able to use Miss Toomine any more.

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:28.280
But I can still get the other two to work hard.

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:37.940
This is a good chance to see how the alien fighters have improved.

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:44.820
— Kumi.
— Yuri. Watch.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.960
Did you see it?

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:52.930
Yeah, for a second.

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:54.990
Good.

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:57.180
We just can't see them.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:01.510
They're all still here, nobody's left.

00:16:01.510 --> 00:16:02.890
Nobody's gone away.

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:05.360
Kumi?

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.690
Come on, help me!

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:12.610
We're going to help Kasumi.

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:18.790
Why?

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:21.790
Why are you going to kill me, a living creature?

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:26.170
I tried so hard not to let anyone come close!

00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:30.670
I tried. I tried so hard.

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:34.260
Help me, Kasumi.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:37.390
I'm going to die unless you do something!

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:41.610
I'm going to die. Die, die!

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:43.640
Help me, Kasumi.

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:47.080
Yes, brother.

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:52.990
The pain stopped.

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:59.850
Vice Principal, let the students go home.

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:00.990
Okay.

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:08.730
Done.

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:12.450
You did well, Yuri.

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:44.910
Kumi!

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:54.550
Kumi! Kumi!

00:17:56.520 --> 00:17:57.470
Kumi!

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:13.480
Why, why, why...?

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:32.450
Kasumi.

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:55.690
Kumi! Kasumi?

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:04.630
Stop her, Yuri! Help your partner!

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:06.580
If you don't hurry and do it, I will!

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:14.370
Kumi... Kumi... Kumi...

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:19.380
Kumi, I will kill Kasumi.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:19.470
No... don't!
Kumi, I will kill Kasumi.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:22.340
No... don't!

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:25.250
Don't kill her...

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:28.700
Don't kill Kasumi.

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:32.000
No, don't kill anyone.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:36.360
No, don't kill her.

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:40.140
I don't want her to die.

00:19:40.140 --> 00:19:45.360
I don't want her to die.
I don't want anyone to die.

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:47.620
I don't want any death.

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:51.580
My master's life is the most important!

00:19:51.970 --> 00:19:53.540
No!

00:20:06.290 --> 00:20:07.640
Kasumi!

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:18.980
Kasumi! Stop! Don't do this!

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:22.450
You're wrong! You can't do this!

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:26.170
Kumi tried so hard to save you, Kasumi.

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:28.910
Please don't! Please stop!

00:20:28.910 --> 00:20:33.160
We're all friends, let's just get along.

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:36.670
I can't take this any more.

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:38.630
Kasumi.

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:42.640
Kasumi, it's okay.

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:49.930
That's enough.

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:54.310
Good-bye, Kasumi.

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:23.900
I thought she was perfect.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:26.550
But Yellow Knife found her weakness.

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:30.540
Pull yourself together, Megumi.

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:33.210
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:37.270
Miss Toomine was the best one of them all, wasn't she?

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:39.090
Yes.

00:21:39.090 --> 00:21:43.380
Make sure this doesn't happen to Miss Kawamura of the Wisteria class.

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:46.410
Or else you'll be stuck with Miss Ootani.

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:49.570
What?! That'd be terrible!

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:52.790
I'm sorry.

00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:56.520
I wonder who brought it.

00:21:56.520 --> 00:21:57.710
What?

00:21:58.660 --> 00:22:00.670
Yellow Knife.

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:04.950
It said that it didn't want to come here, remember?

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:07.960
That it was our fault.

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:13.790
The unexpected arrival of Yellow Knife.

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:18.010
Somebody is trying to interfere with us.

00:22:30.590 --> 00:22:35.100
Are you feeling better now, Kasumi?

00:22:36.280 --> 00:22:39.930
If you are feeling better, I'd like to eat.

00:22:39.930 --> 00:22:42.640
I'm absolutely starving.

00:22:45.150 --> 00:22:46.300
Kasumi?

00:22:50.510 --> 00:22:52.260
You are Kasumi, are you not?

00:23:10.510 --> 00:23:14.160
Mum! Mum?

00:23:15.570 --> 00:23:16.710
Yeah.

00:23:16.710 --> 00:23:19.240
No, I'm okay.

00:23:19.240 --> 00:23:22.480
No, nothing's the matter.

00:23:22.480 --> 00:23:24.040
Nothing's wrong.

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:26.410
Nothing's the matter.
